# Project Build Log — DOCK 6.13.1 on macOS

## Initial State (Sat 16 May 2026)

### System
- macOS 26.4.1 (darwin25)
- Apple Silicon (arm64)
- Xcode CLT with Apple Clang 21.0.0
- Homebrew GCC 11.5.0 and 15.2.0_1

### Problem
`./configure homebrew` and initial `make` failed. The generated `config.h` had:
- `CC=gcc`, `CXX=g++` → Apple Clang (not GCC!)
- `FC=gfortran-11` → GCC 11 (targets MacOSX14.sdk, no longer available)
- `LOAD=g++-11` → GCC 11 (ABI mismatch with Clang objects)
- Missing `-D_DARWIN_C_SOURCE` in CFLAGS/CXXFLAGS (partial fix from libgphoto2#552)
- Missing `YACC` definition (tleap needs it for parser.y)

## Fix Applied (Sat 16 May 2026 12:31)

Edited `install/config.h`:
- `gcc-11` → `gcc-15` (CC, was Apple Clang alias in previous attempt)
- `g++-11` → `g++-15` (CXX)
- `gfortran-11` → `gfortran-15` (FC) — avoids SDK mismatch (MacOSX14.sdk not found)
- `g++-11` → `g++-15` (LOAD) — consistent linker
- Added `-D_DARWIN_C_SOURCE -D_XOPEN_SOURCE=600` to CFLAGS and CXXFLAGS
- Added `YACC= yacc` for tleap parser generation

### Build Attempt 1 — NAB strdup error
`sff.c:1615` strdup implicit declaration. Root cause: `OCFLAGS=-O3 -D_ANSI_SOURCE` suppresses POSIX functions even though `-D$(LEX)` adds `-D_DARWIN_C_SOURCE`.
Fix: Replaced `-D_ANSI_SOURCE` with `-D_DARWIN_C_SOURCE` in OCFLAGS.

### Build Attempt 2 — NAB C function prototype errors
`reslib.c:289` and many more: GCC 15 defaults to `-std=gnu23` where empty `()` in C declarations means `(void)`, breaking K&R-style NAB code.
Fix: Added `-std=gnu17` to CFLAGS.

### Build Attempt 3 — SUCCESS for dock6
`dock6` built successfully (2.5M) at `bin/dock6`.

### Utils Build Attempt 1 — tleap yacc failure
`/usr/bin/yacc` requires Xcode.app but only CLT installed.
Fix: installed Homebrew bison (`brew install bison`), set `YACC=/opt/homebrew/opt/bison/bin/bison --yacc`.

### Utils Build Attempt 2 — bison output filename
Homebrew bison 3.8.2 outputs `parser.tab.c` not `y.tab.c`.
Fix: added `--yacc` flag to bison invocation for yacc-compatible output.

### Final Build — COMPLETE SUCCESS (Sat 16 May 2026 12:38)
All executables built and installed in `bin/`:
- dock6 (2.5M) — main executable
- accessories: showbox, showsphere, sphgen, sphere_selector
