## Optimization Pass (Sat 16 May 2026 12:49)

### Removed -D_XOPEN_SOURCE=600
Verified: `-D_XOPEN_SOURCE=600` is redundant when `-D_DARWIN_C_SOURCE` is present on macOS. Both enable POSIX extensions (including `strdup`), and `_DARWIN_C_SOURCE` is the superset. Compiled `sff.c` without it as a quick test, then full clean rebuild — zero errors.

### Added Optimization Flags
Changed from `-O2` to full optimization:
- `-O3` — max safe optimization level
- `-march=native` — tune for Apple Silicon M-series
- `-ffast-math` — relax IEEE FP compliance for speed (user confirmed used historically)
- `-flto` — link-time optimization across translation units
- `-pipe` — faster compilation (pipes instead of temp files)

Applied to CFLAGS, CXXFLAGS, OCFLAGS (minus pipe for FFLAGS). Added `-flto` to LIBS for linker.

Full clean rebuild (`make -i distclean → make all`): **37/37 executables built, zero errors.**

