### Test Results
Test suite (`make test`) exits 0. All scoring results (mol2 files) PASS — docking calculations are numerically identical. Dockout diffs are only "Virtual memory" / "Physical memory" format lines (cosmetic).

Minor differences from `-ffast-math` in utility outputs:
