**Phase 1 — Instrumentation build** (21:23:57): Built dock6 with `-fprofile-generate=/tmp/dock6_pgo_gcda` via DOCKBUILDFLAGS in `pgo_build_phase1.log`. Utilities built normally (no PGO flags). Zero errors.

