**Phase 3 — Optimized rebuild** (21:38:34–21:39:58): Deleted dock6 `.o` files, rebuilt with `-fprofile-use=/tmp/dock6_pgo_gcda -fprofile-correction`. Log in `pgo_build_phase3.log`. Zero errors (warnings only: nodiscard in `conf_gen_ga.cpp:9033`, old-style `mmo_yyinput`, deprecated `-ld_classic`, and existing NAB `free_vector` warnings).

